OL,3,ARussell Brand is a 'sexual predator who
OL,4,Ahas no remorse', victim tells
OL,5,Asentencing hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing the verdicts last week, judge
OL,8,FMr Justice Bennathan told Brand to
OL,9,Fexpect "a significant custodial term"
OL,11,FIn total, he faced seven charges: three
OL,12,Fof rape, three of sexual assault and
OL,13,Fone of attempted indecent assault. He
OL,14,Fwas found not guilty on three counts
OL,16,FBrand's crimes took place between 2004
OL,17,Fand 2009, and related to four women.
OL,18,FThey are all entitled to lifelong
OL,19,Fanonymity
